{10}{Smugglers' Cove. Cargo comes in, cargo goes out, and nobody asks for a customs receipt. There's a tavern and a few warehouses down by the water. The dockmaster keeps track of the boats.}{Smugglers' Cove. Cargo comes in, cargo goes out, and nobody asks for a customs receipt. There's a tavern and a few warehouses down by the water. The dockmaster keeps track of the boats.}{}{}{}{}
